  "decides": "Owner kind is a person or a team and never free text or a group or role converted into a non-human identity; identity kind is workload, service, automation, bot or integration, lifecycle is active, disabled or retired, and an active identity cannot already be expired. A shared account additionally requires an accountable owner person and a shared justification and is never treated as human.",
